{
    "title": "Bus Simulator - Bus Games 3D",
    "description": "<b>\ud83d\ude8cCity Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games\ud83d\ude8c</b> \r\n\r\nGet ready to take your driver seat and establish your bus company in bus driving games. Before diving into the bus simulator you have to select your character with a specific name, though you can also skip this step. Selecting a city bus is necessary but at the start you only have one unlocked real bus. But don\u2019t worry, the daily reward will give you coins for seven days to get another passenger bus. On the seventh day, you will receive a bonus reward which also includes a bus. Multiple modes are also added e.g., city mode, highway mode, off-the-road, and AI-based multiplayer mode to become a real bus driver. A plane crash in the city and on an emergency basis your bus simulator is needed to pick up the passenger from the airport. You must safely pick up and drop off passengers with the city coach bus. By completing challenges, progress through levels and do not forget to collect coins on your way with a real bus. \r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude8cGame Modes\ud83d\ude8c</b>\r\n\r\n<b>City Mode:</b> Navigate through urban environments.\r\n<b>Highway Mode:</b> Drive on highways and hill areas.\r\n<b>Off the Roads Mode:</b> Explore off-road terrain.\r\n<b>AI-Based Multiplayer:</b> Where players can race against opponents and collect coins.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude8cAdditional Challenges\ud83d\ude8c</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Hill Areas:</b> Driving challenges in hilly areas.\r\n<b>Weather Effects:</b> Driving safely in rain or snowfall.\r\n<b>Unlock Modern Buses:</b> Players unlock advanced buses with enhanced features as they progress, offering improved speed, acceleration, braking, and steering capabilities.\r\n<b>Fuel Refill</b> You need to manage fuel during gameplay.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude8cBus Simulator - Bus Games 3D\ud83d\ude8c</b>\r\n\r\nGet behind the wheel in City Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games. You will face multiple weather effects in bus simulation but the objective is the same: pick the passenger from one point and drop them to their destination. Explore the city areas by navigating through maps in bus games. Whether you navigate through an urban environment or drive on a highway you have to follow bus driving rules to become a real bus driver.  \r\n\r\nDrive safe and drop passengers as soon as possible. As a public transporter bus driver you have to take care of disabled people and also to keep pedestrians safe. Around a lively city keep an eye on fuel refill. Collecting coins while driving will help to unlock a public transport bus simulator 2021 that has different attributes. Drive safely on rainy days but featuring detailed maps all over the city will help you in bus games. After playing some initial level of city mode the AI-based multiplayer mode of the bus unlocked. Where you have to beat your opponent's coach bus and avoid overspeeding.       \r\n\r\n<b>Features of City Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude8c High-quality graphics\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Manage your own business\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Build relationships with passengers\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Detailed maps all over the city\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Multiple options to control city coach buses like tilt, buttons, and steering wheel\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Detailed interior of bus\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Multiple radio stations\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Realistic weather snow, rain, and many more\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Real traffic rules and camera views\r\n\ud83d\ude8c Detailed cockpits of city bus\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? The company\u2019s success is in your hands, enjoy City Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games and give your precious feedback.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>\ud83d\ude8cCity Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games\ud83d\ude8c</b> <br><br>Get ready to take your driver seat and establish your bus company in bus driving games. Before diving into the bus simulator you have to select your character with a specific name, though you can also skip this step. Selecting a city bus is necessary but at the start you only have one unlocked real bus. But don\u2019t worry, the daily reward will give you coins for seven days to get another passenger bus. On the seventh day, you will receive a bonus reward which also includes a bus. Multiple modes are also added e.g., city mode, highway mode, off-the-road, and AI-based multiplayer mode to become a real bus driver. A plane crash in the city and on an emergency basis your bus simulator is needed to pick up the passenger from the airport. You must safely pick up and drop off passengers with the city coach bus. By completing challenges, progress through levels and do not forget to collect coins on your way with a real bus. <br><br><b>\ud83d\ude8cGame Modes\ud83d\ude8c</b><br><br><b>City Mode:</b> Navigate through urban environments.<br><b>Highway Mode:</b> Drive on highways and hill areas.<br><b>Off the Roads Mode:</b> Explore off-road terrain.<br><b>AI-Based Multiplayer:</b> Where players can race against opponents and collect coins.<br><br><b>\ud83d\ude8cAdditional Challenges\ud83d\ude8c</b><br><br><b>Hill Areas:</b> Driving challenges in hilly areas.<br><b>Weather Effects:</b> Driving safely in rain or snowfall.<br><b>Unlock Modern Buses:</b> Players unlock advanced buses with enhanced features as they progress, offering improved speed, acceleration, braking, and steering capabilities.<br><b>Fuel Refill</b> You need to manage fuel during gameplay.<br><br><b>\ud83d\ude8cBus Simulator - Bus Games 3D\ud83d\ude8c</b><br><br>Get behind the wheel in City Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games. You will face multiple weather effects in bus simulation but the objective is the same: pick the passenger from one point and drop them to their destination. Explore the city areas by navigating through maps in bus games. Whether you navigate through an urban environment or drive on a highway you have to follow bus driving rules to become a real bus driver.  <br><br>Drive safe and drop passengers as soon as possible. As a public transporter bus driver you have to take care of disabled people and also to keep pedestrians safe. Around a lively city keep an eye on fuel refill. Collecting coins while driving will help to unlock a public transport bus simulator 2021 that has different attributes. Drive safely on rainy days but featuring detailed maps all over the city will help you in bus games. After playing some initial level of city mode the AI-based multiplayer mode of the bus unlocked. Where you have to beat your opponent&#39;s coach bus and avoid overspeeding.       <br><br><b>Features of City Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games</b><br><br>\ud83d\ude8c High-quality graphics<br>\ud83d\ude8c Manage your own business<br>\ud83d\ude8c Build relationships with passengers<br>\ud83d\ude8c Detailed maps all over the city<br>\ud83d\ude8c Multiple options to control city coach buses like tilt, buttons, and steering wheel<br>\ud83d\ude8c Detailed interior of bus<br>\ud83d\ude8c Multiple radio stations<br>\ud83d\ude8c Realistic weather snow, rain, and many more<br>\ud83d\ude8c Real traffic rules and camera views<br>\ud83d\ude8c Detailed cockpits of city bus<br><br>So, what are you waiting for? The company\u2019s success is in your hands, enjoy City Coach Bus Simulator 2021 - PvP Bus Games and give your precious feedback.",
